I think he made it very clear that _he_ ( as administrator ) decided
not to carry it. Are you suggesting that he should be required to 
accept whatever is offered?. He is undoubtably aware of the worldwide
diversity of the people ( age/religion/race etc.) who anonymously
access _his_ site. He makes the choice about what is appropriate,
and obviously considers that _international_ anonymous access might 
