of principle. It is also a practical way to protect yourself from both
outside criticism and retaliation by narrow-visioned professors and
administrators. Put in bureaucratic terms, it is a great way to pass
the buck and cover your ass.

I'm enclosing a reference to a whole on-line book on selection policy
