files it's being sued over. And after the *first* time they went after
him, the sysop of Event Horizons didn't scan the images himself. People
uploaded them. They still got in trouble. Anybody who thinks it'll be the
*posters* and not the *sites* that'll be gone after is living in a dream 
world. The anonymity you refer to just makes it that much more certain 
that the sites will be the target. You may have trouble proving who posted 
the image, but you can easily prove that a given site has a copy! 

